# Read-only fork: there are no QuickBooks keys to set here.
#
# The server refuses to start if QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_ID, QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_SECRET,
# QUICKBOOKS_REFRESH_TOKEN or QUICKBOOKS_REALM_ID is present in its environment,
# even with an empty value. Leave all four out.
#
# Ticket 286 adds the Stacks token client and documents the new keys here.
